<title>USA: ArgentBank increases qtly div to $0.14.</title>
<headline>ArgentBank increases qtly div to $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>THIBODAUX, La. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ArgentBank said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.14 from $0.13.</p>
<p>The dividend is payble March 14 to shareholders of record Feb 28.</p>
</text>
